{"page": 458, "dpi": 400, "psm": 6, "columns": [[{"text": "LIETH IN WAIT (wueresy ong)", "box": [251, 480, 839, 59], "min_conf": 53.076038}, {"text": "(ΡΩΝ towards, with a view to", "box": [251, 548, 854, 104], "min_conf": 44.294937}, {"text": "τὴν, the, tematized", "box": [286, 604, 802, 74], "min_conf": 93.158989}, {"text": "( Mebobeiay, method, ( 5Y8vematiz", "box": [246, 641, 789, 122], "min_conf": 0.0}, {"text": "system, [error.]", "box": [392, 684, 628, 90], "min_conf": 44.035385}, {"text": "Eph. iv. 14,", "box": [574, 793, 191, 34], "min_conf": 94.27462}, {"text": "LIE IN WAIT FOR.", "box": [405, 908, 532, 44], "min_conf": 94.182587}, {"text": "ἀνεδρεύω, to lie in wait for, esp. in war;", "box": [232, 974, 869, 61], "min_conf": 86.144226}, {"text": "to lie in ambush against.", "box": [340, 1031, 556, 56], "min_conf": 95.93544}, {"text": "Acts xxiii. 16, seo Lying, | Acta xxifi. 21.", "box": [232, 1095, 769, 59], "min_conf": 67.257599}, {"text": "| —__-", "box": [186, 1171, 538, 37], "min_conf": 51.271667}, {"text": "LIE ON.", "box": [563, 1217, 220, 42], "min_conf": 95.6511}, {"text": "| 1. ἐπίκειμαι, to lie upon, be laid upon.", "box": [184, 1234, 918, 126], "min_conf": 72.432526}, {"text": "| 2. ἐπίπιπτω, to fall upon.", "box": [184, 1372, 612, 56], "min_conf": 68.191956}, {"text": "|| 2. John xili, 25 (ἀναπίπτω, lean back, Ga LTTr AN.)", "box": [183, 1434, 917, 71], "min_conf": 19.971176}, {"text": "| 1. Acts xxvii. 20.", "box": [183, 1480, 625, 69], "min_conf": 74.554062}, {"text": "{ —", "box": [183, 1552, 540, 25], "min_conf": 27.51265}, {"text": "_ LIE UPON.", "box": [451, 1609, 366, 62], "min_conf": 65.981056}, {"text": "| ἐπίκειμαι, to lie upon, be laid upon.", "box": [183, 1670, 840, 64], "min_conf": 33.87011}, {"text": "| John xi. 88, with ἐπί,", "box": [182, 1739, 659, 48], "min_conf": 51.607418}, {"text": "LIFE (x1ves.)", "box": [494, 1858, 342, 51], "min_conf": 30.322647}, {"text": "| 1. ξωή, life (akin to dw, anys, to breathe", "box": [182, 1926, 919, 53], "min_conf": 40.797329}, {"text": "the breath of life) the perfect", "box": [338, 1979, 763, 100], "min_conf": 37.625023}, {"text": "' and abiding antithesis to θάνατος,", "box": [182, 2031, 919, 55], "min_conf": 80.826309}, {"text": "(death.)", "box": [342, 2086, 175, 52], "min_conf": 91.298828}, {"text": "[ζωή, is life in all its manifesta-", "box": [288, 2149, 812, 53], "min_conf": 91.418083}, {"text": "| tions, from the life of God down", "box": [180, 2201, 921, 52], "min_conf": 90.444839}, {"text": "| to the life of the lowest vege-", "box": [181, 2238, 918, 72], "min_conf": 92.0355}, {"text": "table. It is necessarily active;", "box": [337, 2311, 762, 53], "min_conf": 95.867546}, {"text": ". it cannot be inert. In its essence", "box": [181, 2363, 919, 56], "min_conf": 39.357574}, {"text": "or nature it is ever the same, and", "box": [340, 2416, 759, 52], "min_conf": 96.15834}, {"text": "| different only in its developments", "box": [180, 2470, 919, 73], "min_conf": 93.301094}, {"text": "or manifestations. Each living", "box": [340, 2523, 759, 57], "min_conf": 87.685844}, {"text": "| person or thing has that portion", "box": [180, 2563, 920, 69], "min_conf": 93.968033}, {"text": "|| of it which is needful for his or", "box": [179, 2610, 922, 63], "min_conf": 62.852322}, {"text": "its designed position or purpose.", "box": [339, 2683, 758, 57], "min_conf": 92.296295}, {"text": "Its one only source is God, who", "box": [339, 2737, 761, 54], "min_conf": 96.118858}, {"text": "| is “the living One.” We live", "box": [178, 2789, 922, 81], "min_conf": 92.264587}, {"text": "! only in and by Hislife. He origi-", "box": [178, 2843, 921, 55], "min_conf": 4.413521}, {"text": "| nates and sustains life in all by", "box": [178, 2887, 922, 65], "min_conf": 90.62957}, {"text": "; giving it out of Himself. “In", "box": [178, 2949, 921, 53], "min_conf": 38.702217}, {"text": "| Him we live and move, and have", "box": [176, 2999, 924, 55], "min_conf": 70.542542}, {"text": "| our being.”", "box": [176, 3047, 420, 68], "min_conf": 92.6791}, {"text": ". ζωή, life, must not be confounded", "box": [177, 3119, 924, 67], "min_conf": 17.175407}, {"text": "with, or defined as “ existence.”", "box": [342, 3185, 756, 49], "min_conf": 90.22641}, {"text": "Existence applies to all created", "box": [340, 3237, 759, 56], "min_conf": 96.231201}, {"text": "things. Life is the property of", "box": [338, 3291, 762, 57], "min_conf": 95.990837}, {"text": "| only some created things to whom", "box": [176, 3313, 919, 105], "min_conf": 95.096893}, {"text": "it has been communicated. What-", "box": [340, 3396, 758, 46], "min_conf": 91.070122}], [{"text": "ever has life has existence; but", "box": [1279, 492, 766, 57], "min_conf": 95.773422}, {"text": "many things have existence which", "box": [1277, 546, 765, 53], "min_conf": 90.7005}, {"text": "have no life.", "box": [1278, 597, 280, 44], "min_conf": 95.039185}, {"text": "ο΄ ζωή also must be distinguished from", "box": [1140, 666, 901, 61], "min_conf": 36.465614}, {"text": "βιός, (No. 8.) In profane and", "box": [1277, 721, 764, 60], "min_conf": 70.730293}, {"text": "classical literature ζωή is not the", "box": [1279, 774, 763, 59], "min_conf": 91.37059}, {"text": "nobler word, because the heathen", "box": [1277, 828, 763, 51], "min_conf": 96.157875}, {"text": "Were ignorant of its true connec-", "box": [1280, 882, 761, 52], "min_conf": 92.517319}, {"text": "| tion with sin and death.", "box": [1140, 934, 680, 48], "min_conf": 82.067986}, {"text": "ο΄ ζωή, as used of the future life which", "box": [1140, 1000, 902, 55], "min_conf": 28.799965}, {"text": "we have now in Christ, is “the", "box": [1279, 1057, 763, 56], "min_conf": 91.660759}, {"text": "gift of God,” (Rom. vi. 23); by", "box": [1280, 1110, 763, 65], "min_conf": 86.497086}, {"text": "| Christ, (John vi. 27, x. 28).", "box": [1140, 1162, 898, 63], "min_conf": 88.189095}, {"text": "| ‘He that hath the Son, hath life ;", "box": [1140, 1212, 901, 67], "min_conf": 0.0}, {"text": "| and he that hath not the Son hath", "box": [1140, 1270, 901, 49], "min_conf": 77.500977}, {"text": "not life,” (1 John ν. 12); now", "box": [1276, 1322, 764, 60], "min_conf": 79.063995}, {"text": "“hid with Christ in God,” (Col.", "box": [1278, 1374, 760, 64], "min_conf": 95.522713}, {"text": "iti. 3.)}", "box": [1277, 1427, 156, 54], "min_conf": 81.802444}, {"text": "2. ψυχή, breath of animal life; one", "box": [1168, 1493, 871, 61], "min_conf": 81.276199}, {"text": "manifestation of ζωή, viz. that", "box": [1275, 1546, 765, 57], "min_conf": 91.925476}, {"text": "which is manifested in animals;", "box": [1275, 1598, 773, 61], "min_conf": 95.637054}, {"text": "hence, life, animal life, the liv-", "box": [1276, 1652, 760, 57], "min_conf": 84.989784}, {"text": "ing individual as such. [In one", "box": [1276, 1705, 762, 62], "min_conf": 94.196808}, {"text": "passage (Is. x. 14), ‘nephesh,’", "box": [1274, 1760, 761, 60], "min_conf": 77.540985}, {"text": "or Ψυχή, is applied to vegetable", "box": [1273, 1813, 762, 60], "min_conf": 67.929321}, {"text": "life. ]", "box": [1272, 1860, 108, 61], "min_conf": 66.565704}, {"text": "3. Bios, life, i.e. the life which we live,", "box": [1164, 1929, 870, 60], "min_conf": 40.114292}, {"text": "the life led; hence, manner of life,", "box": [1273, 1982, 763, 60], "min_conf": 91.093269}, {"text": "period or duration of life, means", "box": [1273, 2036, 761, 56], "min_conf": 96.555344}, {"text": "of living. |", "box": [1274, 2089, 792, 65], "min_conf": 54.395638}, {"text": "[ζωή is life as the gift of God, and !", "box": [1225, 2152, 841, 58], "min_conf": 60.991985}, {"text": "therefore is applied to every-", "box": [1273, 2207, 761, 63], "min_conf": 89.795242}, {"text": "thing which has fife, Bios is ap-", "box": [1273, 2221, 759, 99], "min_conf": 66.173042}, {"text": "lied only to men, who not only", "box": [1302, 2275, 732, 102], "min_conf": 87.613457}, {"text": "five, but lead lives; hence, the", "box": [1268, 2322, 765, 99], "min_conf": 76.764221}, {"text": "difference between the words zo-", "box": [1272, 2419, 761, 51], "min_conf": 92.798607}, {"text": "ology and Biography. ios is", "box": [1273, 2473, 760, 59], "min_conf": 70.662285}, {"text": "used only of the lower life,", "box": [1272, 2527, 758, 57], "min_conf": 90.955048}, {"text": "and has no such worthy use as", "box": [1270, 2579, 762, 59], "min_conf": 94.587639}, {"text": "No. 1.]", "box": [1271, 2633, 149, 51], "min_conf": 88.462036}, {"text": "4. πνεῦμα, wind, breath breathed forth.", "box": [1163, 2697, 869, 50], "min_conf": 66.993713}, {"text": "[When not used for “wind,” it ex-", "box": [1223, 2760, 807, 56], "min_conf": 92.182053}, {"text": "presses immateriality, that which", "box": [1272, 2816, 761, 57], "min_conf": 90.877861}, {"text": "cannot be apprehended by our", "box": [1271, 2869, 763, 60], "min_conf": 88.461823}, {"text": "senses, and which is recognized", "box": [1271, 2921, 763, 60], "min_conf": 96.451538}, {"text": "only by its operations or mani-", "box": [1271, 2973, 761, 56], "min_conf": 91.679298}, {"text": "festations. It is seen in life, live-", "box": [1270, 3026, 763, 54], "min_conf": 87.912262}, {"text": "liness, the activities of life, whether", "box": [1271, 3076, 763, 64], "min_conf": 84.974167}, {"text": "these activities be mental, moral,", "box": [1269, 3132, 764, 59], "min_conf": 95.747444}, {"text": "or physical. The πνεῦμα of God", "box": [1272, 3188, 761, 55], "min_conf": 93.293526}, {"text": "is the source of life in all its mani-", "box": [1271, 3201, 761, 87], "min_conf": 92.655785}, {"text": "festations. The withdrawal of", "box": [1270, 3293, 764, 48], "min_conf": 91.411736}, {"text": "this πνεῦμα leaves θάνατος, (the", "box": [1271, 3346, 763, 58], "min_conf": 91.371956}, {"text": "‘opposite of ζωή).", "box": [1171, 3401, 497, 53], "min_conf": 41.2658}]]}